<view class="page"><view class="title">{{category === 'laundry' ? '洗护服务' : '家政套餐'}}</view><view class="subtitle">选择具体服务，查看规格并下单</view><view class="tabs" wx:if="{{category === 'laundry'}}"><view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{group === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-group="{{item}}" bindtap="group">{{item}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="order"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.description}}</view><view class="price">{{item.priceText}}</view><view class="link">选择规格并下单 →</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !visible.length}}">暂无上架服务</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{category === 'laundry'}}"><view>计价说明</view><view class="meta">衣物：短＜65cm，中65～80cm，长＞80cm。包包按对角线：小＜25cm，中25～50cm，大＞50cm。</view><view class="meta">单熨烫按对应洗护价六折，15元起。小面积皮革加10元起；毛领、特殊处理30元起。洗不掉不收特殊处理费。</view><view class="meta">以上附加项目及半皮革、半皮草需门店确认报价，暂不自动计入订单。</view></view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>